questions.stem:
设 \( y(x) \) 满足 \( 4x\frac{\mathrm{d}^2y}{\mathrm{d}x^2} + 2(1 - \sqrt{x})\frac{\mathrm{d}y}{\mathrm{d}x} - 6y = \mathrm{e}^{-\sqrt{x}} \).
(I) 作变换 \(x = t^{2}(t > 0)\), 将方程变换成 \(y\) 关于 \(t\) 的方程;
(II) 若 \(\lim_{x\to 0^{+}}y(x) = 0,\lim_{x\to +\infty}y(x) = 0\) ，求 \(y(x)\)

设非零函数 \( f(x) \) 有连续导数,且满足 \( f'(x)+2xf^{2}(x)=0,f(0)=1 \) .
(I) 求 \( f(x) \);
(II) 记 \(a_{n} = \int_{-\infty}^{+\infty}[f(x)]^{n}\mathrm{d}x (n = 1,2,\dots)\), 求 \(\sum_{n=1}^{\infty} \frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n} x^n\) 的收敛域与和函数.

设 \( f(x) \) 连续且严格单调递减.
(I) 证明: 当 \(x \in (0,1)\) 时, 有 \(x \int_{0}^{1} f(t) dt < \int_{0}^{x} f(t) dt < xf(0)\);
(II) 若 \(\int_{0}^{1} f(t) dt \geqslant 0, f(0) \leqslant 1, x_{0} \in (0,1), x_{n} = \int_{0}^{x_{n-1}} f(t) dt (n = 1,2,\cdots)\). 证明: \(\lim_{n \to \infty} x_{n}\) 存在, 并求其值.
